//  Relations

      //  Application  to  Workspace

            Application  (  Application  )    1  -->  n    Workspace  (  Workspaces  )

      //  Workspace  to  Documents

            Workspace  (  As Base Of Workspace  )    1  -->  1    Document  (  Base  )    //  Should  be  Inheritant
            Workspace  (  Workspace For Instrument  )    1  -->  n    Document  (  Instruments  )
            Workspace  (  Workspace For Black Box  )    1  -->  n    Document  (  Black Boxes  )
            Workspace  (  Workspace For Template  )    1  -->  n    Document  (  Templates  )    //  In  the  Creator  0.9  code,  the  class  was  Template  ,  but  this  class  doesn't  exist  ,  so  it  must  have  been  an  error  .

      //  Document  to  Elements

            Document  (  Document  )    1  -->  n    Curve  (  Curves  )
            Document  (  Document  )    1  -->  n    Sequence  (  Sequences  )
            Document  (  Document  )    1  -->  n    Scale  (  Scales  )
            Document  (  Document  )    1  -->  n    Patch  (  Patches  )
            Document  (  Document  )    1  -->  n    Dimensioner  (  Dimensioners  )
            Document  (  Document  )    1  -->  n    Analyser  (  Analysers  )
            Document  (  Document  )    1  -->  1    Transport  (  Transport  )

            //  Transport  to  Channels

                  Transport  (  Transport  )    1  -->  n    Sample  (  Samples  )
                        Sample  (  Sample  )  1  -->  n  Sample Sample  (  Samples  )
                  Transport  (  Transport  )    1  -->  n    Wave File Output  (  Wave File Outputs  )
                  Transport  (  Transport  )    1  -->  n    Midi File  (  Midi Files  )
                  Transport  (  Transport  )    1  -->  n    Midi File Output  (  Midi File Outputs  )
                  Transport  (  Transport  )    1  -->  n    Wave In  (  Wave Ins  )
                  Transport  (  Transport  )    1  -->  n    Wave Out  (  Wave Outs  )
                  Transport  (  Transport  )    1  -->  n    Midi In  (  Midi Ins  )
                  Transport  (  Transport  )    1  -->  n    Midi Out  (  Midi Outs  )

            //  Document  to  Inlets  &  Outlets

                  Document  (  Document  )    1  -->  n    Inlet  (  Inlets  )
                  Document  (  Document  )    1  -->  n    Outlet  (  Outlets  )

      //  Element  to  Class

            Curve  (  Curve  )    1  -->  n    Node  (  Nodes  )

            //  Scale  to  Class

                  Scale  (  Scale  )    1  -->  n    Scale Tone  (  Tones  )
                  Scale  (  Scale  )    1  -->  n    Octave  (  Octaves  )
                  Octave  (  Octave  )    1  -->  n    Octave Ordinal  (  Ordinals  )
                  //  Scale Tone  (  Scale Tone  )    1  -->  1    Tone  (  Tone  )  //  !!!  There  is  no  class  named  Tone
                  Scale Tone  (  Scale Tone  )    1  -->  1    Pitch  (  Pitch  )

      //  Output  Channel  to  Operands

            Wave File Output  (  As Wave File Output Left Channel  )    1  -->  1    Outlet  (  Left Channel  )
            Wave File Output  (  As Wave File Output Right Channel  )    1  -->  1    Outlet  (  Right Channel  )

      //  Patch  Relations

            //  Patch  to  Operators

                  //  Patch  to  Operator

                        Patch  (  Patch  )    1  -->  n    Operator  (  Operators  )

                  //  Patch  to  Arithmetic  Operator

                        Patch  (  Patch  )    1  -->  n    Add  (  Additions  )
                        Patch  (  Patch  )    1  -->  n    Value  (  Values  )
                        Patch  (  Patch  )    1  -->  n    Substract  (  Substractions  )
                        Patch  (  Patch  )    1  -->  n    Multiply  (  Multiplications  )
                        Patch  (  Patch  )    1  -->  n    Divide  (  Divisions  )
                        Patch  (  Patch  )    1  -->  n    Power  (  Powers  )
                        Patch  (  Patch  )    1  -->  n    Time Add  (  Time Additions  )
                        Patch  (  Patch  )    1  -->  n    Time Substract  (  Time Substractions  )
                        Patch  (  Patch  )    1  -->  n    Time Multiply  (  Time Multiplications  )
                        Patch  (  Patch  )    1  -->  n    Time Divide  (  Time Divisions  )
                        Patch  (  Patch  )    1  -->  n    Time Power  (  Time Powers  )

                  //  Patch  to  Partial  Operator

                        Patch  (  Patch  )    1  -->  n    Sine  (  Sines  )
                        Patch  (  Patch  )    1  -->  n    Noise  (  Noises  )

                  //  Patch  to  Standard  Custom  Operator

                        Patch  (  Patch  )    1  -->  n    Adder  (  Adders  )

                  //  Patch  to  Black Box  and  Instrument  Operator

                        Patch  (  Patch  )    1  -->  n    Black Box Operator  (  Black Box Operators  )
                        Patch  (  Patch  )    1  -->  n    Instrument Operator  (  Instrument Operators  )

                  //  Patch  to  IO  Operator

                        Patch  (  Patch  )    1  -->  n    Inlet  (  Patch Inlets  )
                        Patch  (  Patch  )    1  -->  n    Outlet  (  Patch Outlets  )
                        Patch  (  Patch  )    1  -->  n    Curve In  (  Curves In  )
                        Patch  (  Patch  )    1  -->  n    Sample Operator  (  Sample Operators  )
                        Patch  (  Patch  )    1  -->  n    Wave In Operator  (  Wave In Operators  )
                        Patch  (  Patch  )    1  -->  n    Midi File Operator  (  Midi File Operators  )
                        Patch  (  Patch  )    1  -->  n    Midi In Operator  (  Midi In Operators  )

                //  Patch  to  Pitch  Operator

                        Patch  (  Patch  )    1  -->  n    Pitch Operator  (  Pitch Operators  )

            //  Operators  Inherting  Operator    (  Should  become  Inheritance  )

                  //  Arithmetic  Operators  Inheriting  Operator

                        Value  (  As Value  )    n  -->  1    Operator  (  Base  )
                        Add  (  As Add  )    n  -->  1    Operator  (  Base  )
                        Substract  (  As Substract  )    n  -->  1    Operator  (  Base  )
                        Multiply  (  As Multiply  )    n  -->  1    Operator  (  Base  )
                        Divide  (  As Divide  )    n  -->  1    Operator  (  Base  )
                        Power  (  As Power  )    n  -->  1    Operator  (  Base  )
                        Time Add  (  As Time Add  )    n  -->  1    Operator  (  Base  )
                        Time Substract  (  As Time Substract  )    n  -->  1    Operator  (  Base  )
                        Time Multiply  (  As Time Multiply  )    n  -->  1    Operator  (  Base  )
                        Time Divide  (  As Time Divide  )    n  -->  1    Operator  (  Base  )
                        Time Power  (  As Time Power  )    n  -->  1    Operator  (  Base  )

                  //  Partial  Operators  Inheriting  Operator

                        Sine  (  As Sine  )    n  -->  1    Operator  (  Base  )
                        Noise  (  As Noise  )    n  -->  1    Operator  (  Base  )

                  //  Standard  Custom  Operators  Inheriting  Operator

                        Adder  (  As Adder  )    n  -->  1    Operator  (  Base  )

                  //  Black Box  &  Instrument  Operators  Inheriting  Operator

                        Black Box Operator  (  As Black Box Operator  )    n  -->  1    Operator  (  Base  )
                        Instrument Operator  (  As Instrument Operator  )    n  -->  1    Operator  (  Base  )

                  //  IO  Operators  Inheriting  Operator

                        Inlet  (  As Patch Inlet  )    n  -->  1    Operator  (  Base  )
                        Outlet  (  As Patch Outlet  )    n  -->  1    Operator  (  Base  )
                        Curve In  (  As Curve In  )    n  -->  1    Operator  (  Base  )
                        Sample Operator  (  As Sample Operator  )    n  -->  1    Operator  (  Base  )
                        Wave In Operator  (  As Wave In Operator  )    n  -->  1    Operator  (  Base  )
                        Midi File Operator  (  As Midi File Operator  )    n  -->  1    Operator  (  Base  )
                        Midi In Operator  (  As Midi In Operator  )    n  -->  1    Operator  (  Base  )

                  //  Pitch  Operator  Inheriting  Operator

                        Pitch Operator  (  As Pitch Operator  )    n  -->  1    Operator  (  Base  )

            //  Operator  to  Operands

                  //  Arithemetic  Operator  to  Operands
      
                        Add  (  As Add Operand A  )    n  -->  1    Operator  (  Operand A  )
                        Add  (  As Add Operand B  )    n  -->  1    Operator  (  Operand B  )

                        Substract  (  As Substract Operand A  )    n  -->  1    Operator  (  Operand A  )
                        Substract  (  As Substract Operand B  )    n  -->  1    Operator  (  Operand B  )

                        Multiply  (  As Multiply Operand A  )    n  -->  1    Operator  (  Operand A  )
                        Multiply  (  As Multiply Operand B  )    n  -->  1    Operator  (  Operand B  )
                        Multiply  (  As Multiply Axis  )    n  -->  1    Operator  (  Axis  )

                        Divide  (  As Divide Numerator  )    n  -->  1    Operator  (  Numerator  )
                        Divide  (  As Divide Denominator  )    n  -->  1    Operator  (  Denominator  )
                        Divide  (  As Divide Axis  )    n  -->  1    Operator  (  Axis  )

                        Power  (  As Power Arithmetic Base  )    n  -->  1    Operator  (  Arithmetic Base  )
                        Power  (  As Power Exponent  )    n  -->  1    Operator  (  Exponent  )

                        Time Add  (  As Time Add Level Operand  )    n  -->  1    Operator  (  Level  )
                        Time Add  (  As Time Add Time Difference Operand  )    n  -->  1    Operator  (  Time Difference  )

                        Time Substract  (  As Time Substract Level Operand  )    n  -->  1    Operator  (  Level  )
                        Time Substract  (  As Time Substract Time Difference Operand  )    n  -->  1    Operator  (  Time Difference  )

                        Time Multiply  (  As Time Multiply Level Operand  )    n  -->  1    Operator  (  Level  )
                        Time Multiply  (  As Time Multiply Time Multiplier Operand  )    n  -->  1    Operator  (  Time Multiplier  )
                        Time Multiply  (  As Time Multiply Axis Operand  )    n  -->  1    Operator  (  Axis  )

                        Time Divide  (  As Time Divide Level Operand  )    n  -->  1    Operator  (  Level  )
                        Time Divide  (  As Time Divide Time Divider Operand  )    n  -->  1    Operator  (  Time Divider  )
                        Time Divide  (  As Time Divide Axis Operand  )    n  -->  1    Operator  (  Axis  )

                        Time Power  (  As Time Power Level Operand  )    n  -->  1    Operator  (  Level  )
                        Time Power  (  As Time Power Time Exponent  )    n  -->  1    Operator  (  Time Exponent  )

                  //  Partial  Operator  to  Operands

                        Sine  (  As Sine Volume  )    n  -->  1    Operator  (  Volume  )
