                        Noise  (  As Noise High Pitch  )    n  -->  1    Operator  (  High Pitch  )
                        Noise  (  As Noise Pitch Interval  )    n  -->  1    Operator  (  Pitch Interval  )

                  //  Standard  Custom  Operators  to  Operands

                        Adder  (  As Adder Operand 1  )    n  -->  1    Operator  (  Operand 1  )
