                  //  (  perhaps  put  the  term  'Reference'  in  the  object  names  some  day  ,  for  clarity  .  )

                  Black Box Operator  (  As Black Box Operator  )    n  -->  1    Document  (  Black Box  )
                  Instrument Operator  (  As Instrument Operator  )    n  -->  1    Document  (  Instrument  )
                  Curve In  (  As Curve In  )    n  -->  1    Curve  (  Curve  )
